WEBVTT

00:15:29.883 --> 00:15:34.096
I hope that these examples
have revealed to you

00:15:34.137 --> 00:15:37.724
what they can be today and for tomorrow.

00:15:38.433 --> 00:15:44.231
Unions once significantly reduced
income inequality,

00:15:44.272 --> 00:15:46.441
the gap between the rich and the poor.

00:15:47.067 --> 00:15:48.402
They can again.

00:15:49.611 --> 00:15:55.117
These graph lines came together
when unions rose.

00:15:55.826 --> 00:16:00.455
I'd like to see those lines
permanently converge